# Kanban RSC page (Next production track) - renders the precompiled
# KanbanBoard.client.js "use client" interactive island from a PythScribe
# server component. next-plugin-pyths's loader rewrites the extensionless
# relative import below to the precompiled island automatically (see
# CONTRIBUTING.md '"use client" islands in the Next shell').
# Dual-track with app/react-reference/kanban/page.tsx.
#
# NOTE: `#` comments, not a triple-quoted docstring - see CONTRIBUTING.md
